 "description": "Telemetry measurement units. Each unit has its measure group and the factor to the WI unit of that group (value x factor = WI unit). WI units: flow l/s, volume m3, pressure m head, level m. A null factor = not convertible from the delivery alone (a percentage of full needs the asset's height). Codes are unique across the list, so the pressure and level metres are m_head and m_level.",
